\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4.3}{\ignorespaces LLM models employed by the specialized agents of the AI Manager Module. The model allocation follows the functional complexity of the agents. The core orchestration agents use the larger Llama 3.3 70B model, as they are responsible for planning, evidence synthesis, and investigation validation. In contrast, the tool-support agents use the smaller Llama 3.1 8B model, since their tasks are more constrained and domain-specific, such as query reformulation, parameter extraction, and relevance filtering.}}{67}{table.caption.65}%
